# Docker obeys THIS file, not .gitignore. That distinction matters here: `.ralph/` is gitignored but
# would still be copied into an image layer by a broad `COPY . .`, and it contains REFERENCE.md —
# the proprietary reference app's name and local path. CLAUDE.md's guardrail is "no proprietary
# references, even by accident"; this is the accident it is guarding against.
#
# server/Dockerfile currently copies only the built distribution, so nothing here is load-bearing
# today. It exists so that a future edit reintroducing a broad COPY fails safe.

# Proprietary-reference material and agent working state
.ralph/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Local machine config — sdk.dir points at a host path that is meaningless in a container and would
# shadow ANDROID_HOME if an SDK were ever added.
local.properties

# VCS and build output
.git/
.github/
build/
*/build/
**/build/
.gradle/
*/.gradle/

# Large assets that no runtime image needs
docs/
fastlane/
maestro/

.DS_Store
*.log
